title: Loopholes
text: Three archers, three loopholes, one white arrow.
trick: the prism fans white into three angles; the loopholes are conduits that pass only one slant, so the prism must sit where the green ray already fits and the blue and red rays are bent into theirs
motif: a castle wall of walls with three slanted loopholes (diagonal conduits)
ink: 4
expect: recolours>=1
